{
  "summary": "The experiment tested a multimodal model using multiprofile data with avgpool aggregation, achieving validation accuracy of 0.6186 and F1 of 0.6103, significantly higher than prior multimodal baselines. This suggests multiprofile data and avgpool aggregation may contribute to performance gains, though their individual impact remains uncertain due to lack of direct comparison with singleprofile or alternative aggregation methods. The effectiveness of concat fusion relative to other strategies is still unclear."
}

